          <Pad Id="Q2v2PX0SNKTMWyof1ef0OU" Bounds="12,22,304,402" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="WHAT IS IT?&#xD;&#xA;This helppatch demonstrates how to communicate with a pen plotter directly from vvvv. The workflow is simple: you create an .svg file using any software, load it into vvvv, and send it to the plotter. This approach removes the need for external programs like Inkscape, offering a faster workflow and greater flexibility for customisation.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;HOW DOES IT WORK?&#xD;&#xA;Behind the scenes, the patch uses the Python-based AxiDraw CLI library. This means you’ll need to have Python installed on your machine, along with the AxiDraw CLI library. Once set up, vvvv can send plot commands directly to the plotter via this library.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="Pa1JhjujGlSMqBRjesXSso" Bounds="340,22,324,399" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="INSTALLATION&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Follow the installation instructions provided on the official AxiDraw CLI documentation page:&#xD;&#xA;https://axidraw.com/doc/cli\_api/#introduction&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;After installing, you’ll need to locate your Python installation folder. This is typically found at:&#xD;&#xA;C:\Users\[your_username]\AppData\Local\Programs&#xD;&#xA;\Python\Python313\python.exe&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Next, locate the configuration file for the pen plotter, usually found at:&#xD;&#xA;C:\Users\[your_username]\AppData\Local\Programs&#xD;&#xA;\Python\Python313\Lib\site-packages&#xD;&#xA;\axidrawinternal\axidraw_conf.py&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Make a copy of this file and place it in your working directory. Do not modify the original file — keep it unchanged to ensure the AxiDraw CLI continues to function properly.&#xD;&#xA;">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
